      "@id": "#claim",
      "@type": "Claim",
      "name": "Entry 48: formal equivalence testing (TOST) for the parity claims — pre-registration",
      "text": "TOST at a registered ±1.0 pp margin, 90% CI of the difference of medians under paired stratified resampling: four equivalent, six inconclusive, none outside the margin. Both transfer pools are formally equivalent — D3+D4 [−0.90, −0.33] and D3–D5 [−0.55, −0.07] — upgrading the headline claim from a failure to reject. D1 is inconclusive at n = 44 on both protocols, as predicted. Five of six inconclusive verdicts fail on the side where the LAW BEATS the simulation (D3's CI is wholly negative), so reading 'inconclusive' as a weakness of the law is backwards.",
      "appearance": [
        {
          "@id": "https://github.com/danlessa/bicycling-energy-model/blob/main/research/journal/MODEL_COMPARISON_JOURNAL.md"
        }
      ],
